                                                    
                                                    🗺️ Framework Hierarchy
                                                    
                                                    mermaid
                                                    graph TD
                                                        Collection --> List
                                                        Collection --> Set
                                                        Collection --> Queue
                                                        
                                                        List --> ArrayList
                                                        List --> LinkedList
                                                        List --> Vector
                                                        
                                                        Set --> HashSet
                                                        Set --> LinkedHashSet
                                                        Set --> SortedSet
                                                        SortedSet --> TreeSet
                                                        
                                                        Queue --> PriorityQueue
                                                        Queue --> Deque
                                                        Deque --> ArrayDeque
                                                        Deque --> LinkedList
                                                        
                                                        Map --> HashMap
                                                        Map --> LinkedHashMap
                                                        Map --> Hashtable
                                                        Map --> SortedMap
                                                        SortedMap --> TreeMap



                                              ⚡ The Big-O Cheat Sheet
                                              
                                              Choosing the wrong collection can ruin your application's performance. Use this quick lookup table to select the right tool for the job.
                                              
                                              Interface	Implementation	Access (Get)	Insertion	Deletion	Ordering / Features
                                              List	ArrayList	🟢 O(1)	🟡 O(n)	🟡 O(n)	Insertion order, index-based access.
                                              List	LinkedList	🟡 O(n)	🟢 O(1)	🟢 O(1)	Doubly-linked list, fast sequential inserts.
                                              Set	HashSet	🟢 O(1)	🟢 O(1)	🟢 O(1)	No duplicates, chaotic order.
                                              Set	LinkedHashSet	🟢 O(1)	🟢 O(1)	🟢 O(1)	No duplicates, maintains insertion order.
                                              Set	TreeSet	🟡 \(O(\log n)\)	🟡 \(O(\log n)\)	🟡 \(O(\log n)\)	Sorted naturally or via Comparator.
                                              Queue	PriorityQueue	🔴 N/A	🟡 \(O(\log n)\)	🟡 \(O(\log n)\)	Min-Heap / Max-Heap behavior.
                                              Map	HashMap	🟢 O(1)	🟢 O(1)	🟢 O(1)	Key-value pairs, fast lookups.
                                              Map	TreeMap	🟡 \(O(\log n)\)	🟡 \(O(\log n)\)	🟡 \(O(\log n)\)	Sorted by keys.





